{"id":"n23398-1-8","stage":3,"title":"눈병 · 眼疾","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n23398-1-8-1","ko":"눈에 웬 안대를 끼고 있어?","zh":"你眼睛上怎么戴着眼罩啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"눈에","meaning":"眼睛","explanation":"눈：眼睛；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72704","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"웬","meaning":"什么，哪儿来的","explanation":"웬：什么，哪儿来的","readings":[{"term":"웬","audio":"/audio/0eb778191ab3a0e588b9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69527","senseId":"1","lemma":"웬","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안대를","meaning":"眼罩","explanation":"안대：眼罩；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"안대","audio":"/audio/e6c8df58a425063863ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66393","senseId":"1","lemma":"안대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끼고","meaning":"被戴着，被夹着","explanation":"끼다：被戴着，被夹着；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"끼다","audio":"/audio/62c9da6515c8237ff0f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38439","senseId":"2","lemma":"끼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ab1b14816087979d","term":"눈","zh":"眼睛","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3","entryId":"72704","definition":"人或动物的一种感觉器官，位于脸部，受光线刺激后能看到物体。","pronunciation":["눈"]},{"id":"0eb778191ab3a0e5","term":"웬","zh":"什么，哪儿来的","audio":"/audio/0eb778191ab3a0e588b9.mp3","entryId":"69527","definition":"不知道怎么回事。","pronunciation":["웬ː"]},{"id":"e6c8df58a4250638","term":"안대","zh":"眼罩","audio":"/audio/e6c8df58a425063863ec.mp3","entryId":"66393","definition":"生眼病时遮盖患病的眼睛的布块。","pronunciation":["안ː대"]},{"id":"62c9da6515c8237f","term":"끼다","zh":"被戴着，被夹着","audio":"/audio/62c9da6515c8237ff0f1.mp3","entryId":"38439","definition":"某物为挂在某个东西上不掉下来而被串或插进去。","pronunciation":["끼ː다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/9a29d95dedb65bce4294.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n23398-1-8-2","ko":"응, 심한 눈병에 걸렸거든.","zh":"嗯，我得了严重的眼疾。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"심한","meaning":"严重","explanation":"심하다：严重；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"심하다","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65046","senseId":"1","lemma":"심하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"눈병에","meaning":"眼疾","explanation":"눈병：眼疾；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"눈병","audio":"/audio/4c674192f6ffda6b2b60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23398","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈병","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걸렸거든.","meaning":"患","explanation":"걸리다：患；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"걸리다","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86940","senseId":"8","lemma":"걸리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"a1212e5a4cc18554","term":"심하다","zh":"严重","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3","entryId":"65046","definition":"程度过头。","pronunciation":["심ː하다"]},{"id":"4c674192f6ffda6b","term":"눈병","zh":"眼疾","audio":"/audio/4c674192f6ffda6b2b60.mp3","entryId":"23398","definition":"眼睛部位生的病。","pronunciation":["눈뼝"]},{"id":"d94590a358564fb8","term":"걸리다","zh":"患","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3","entryId":"86940","definition":"得病。","pronunciation":["걸리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9b14d1be842c52bc527c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.009,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=23398","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":104,"sequenceScore":2.7343,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你眼睛上怎么戴着眼罩啊？","嗯，我得了严重的眼疾。","今天是中秋节，会有开门的餐厅吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你眼睛上怎么戴着眼罩啊？","嗯，我得了严重的眼疾。","今天是中秋节，会有开门的餐厅吗？"],"answer":1}]}
